{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"玛丽·居里·思想与方法","stage":"DONE","category":"marie-curie","categoryLabel":"玛丽·居里","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/30_marie-curie/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"玛丽-居里的思想与方法\">玛丽·居里的思想与方法</h1><p>居里夫人留给科学的，不只是钋、镭与放射性这些具体成果，还有一种可被后人效法的治学方式与精神气质。本卷把焦点从&quot;她发现了什么&quot;转向&quot;她如何思考与工作&quot;，剖析支撑其成就的方法论与价值观。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>玛丽·居里这一人物集合下设六卷，各有侧重。本卷只谈<strong>方法论与价值观</strong>，刻意不复述史实与成果细节——同一事实只在其主篇展开，本卷以交叉链接引用，避免重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>她的人生轨迹</td>\n<td>提供方法成形的传记背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>她发现了什么</td>\n<td>本卷方法所<strong>产出</strong>的成果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>思想与方法（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>她<strong>如何</strong>思考与工作</td>\n<td>抽取方法论与精神，串起其他卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要作品</a></td>\n<td>论文、奖项、机构</td>\n<td>方法的载体与里程碑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>她改变了什么</td>\n<td>本卷理想的长期回响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>如何评判她</td>\n<td>本卷品格的反面与代价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>「核心贡献」讲成果，本卷讲成果背后的方法与精神。</strong> 读「她不申请专利&quot;这件事的来龙去脉，看本卷的<a href=\"scientific-ideals/science-as-a-public-good\">科学属于全人类</a>；读&quot;镭研究所&quot;这个机构本身，去<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条线索\">三条线索</h2><p>本卷沿三章展开，对应方法、品格、理想：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 测量优先的方法</strong>：她把精密测量奉为研究根基，以可量化数据取代主观印象（<a href=\"measurement-first-method/precision-and-quantification\">精密测量与量化精神</a>），并独创&quot;以放射性为向导&quot;追踪不可见物质（<a href=\"measurement-first-method/tracking-the-invisible\">以放射性追踪不可见之物</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 坚韧与严谨</strong>：近乎苦行的耐力（<a href=\"perseverance-and-rigor/asceticism-and-endurance\">苦行般的坚韧与耐力</a>），以及把客观事实置于个人荣誉之上的态度（<a href=\"perseverance-and-rigor/objectivity-over-recognition\">客观性高于个人荣誉</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 科学理想</strong>：坚信科学应服务全人类、拒绝以发现牟利（<a href=\"scientific-ideals/science-as-a-public-good\">科学属于全人类</a>），以及淡泊名利、献身科学的纯粹气质（<a href=\"scientific-ideals/disinterest-and-dedication\">淡泊名利与献身科学</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    M[测量优先的方法] --&gt;|落地需要| P[坚韧与严谨的品格]&#10;    P --&gt;|服务于| I[科学公益的理想]&#10;    M -.产出.-&gt; R[钋·镭·放射性]&#10;    I -.回响.-&gt; L[开放科学·机构遗产]\">flowchart LR\n    M[测量优先的方法] --&gt;|落地需要| P[坚韧与严谨的品格]\n    P --&gt;|服务于| I[科学公益的理想]\n    M -.产出.-&gt; R[钋·镭·放射性]\n    I -.回响.-&gt; L[开放科学·机构遗产]</pre><h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先读<a href=\"../life-and-times/paris-and-discovery/\">生平·巴黎与发现</a>与<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>，了解她发现了什么，再回到本卷看&quot;如何做到&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>建议顺序</strong>：方法（第一章）→ 品格（第二章）→ 理想（第三章）。方法是基础，品格让方法落地，理想为一切赋予意义。</li>\n<li><strong>若只读一篇</strong>：从<a href=\"measurement-first-method/precision-and-quantification\">精密测量与量化精神</a>入手——它是理解居里夫人全部工作的钥匙。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些思想与方法，使居里夫人超越了一位成功科学家的范畴，成为现代实证科学精神的化身。理解它们，不仅有助于读懂她的成就，也为今天的研究者提供了一面关于何为&quot;科学态度&quot;的镜子。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"measurement-first-method","title":"以测量为本的实验方法","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/measurement-first-method","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"precision-and-quantification","title":"精密测量与量化精神","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/measurement-first-method/precision-and-quantification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tracking-the-invisible","title":"以放射性追踪不可见之物","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/measurement-first-method/tracking-the-invisible"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"perseverance-and-rigor","title":"坚韧与严谨的工作风格","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/perseverance-and-rigor","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asceticism-and-endurance","title":"苦行般的坚韧与耐力","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/perseverance-and-rigor/asceticism-and-endurance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"objectivity-over-recognition","title":"客观性高于个人荣誉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/perseverance-and-rigor/objectivity-over-recognition"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"scientific-ideals","title":"科学理想与价值观","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/scientific-ideals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"science-as-a-public-good","title":"科学属于全人类","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/scientific-ideals/science-as-a-public-good"},{"seq":2,"slug":"disinterest-and-dedication","title":"淡泊名利与献身科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/ideas-and-methods/scientific-ideals/disinterest-and-dedication"}]}]}